flowchart TB
  subgraph host [Host machine]
    API[FastAPI]
    Worker[Worker]
    Harbor[Harbor CLI]
    SpecAgent[spec_agent LLM loop]
    Improver[Improver LLM]
  end

  subgraph docker [Docker]
    Bash[bash tool via environment.exec]
    Verifier[Terminal-Bench verifier]
  end

  subgraph external [External]
    ModelAPI[OpenAI / Anthropic / etc]
  end

  Worker --> Harbor
  Harbor --> SpecAgent
  SpecAgent -->|chat completions| ModelAPI
  SpecAgent -->|tool calls| Bash
  Harbor --> Verifier
  Worker --> Improver
  Improver -->|propose AgentSpec| ModelAPI

  API -.->|no Harbor| Worker
